<Base title="Get Involved" description="Learn about planned volunteering and community participation with GEAR Moto Foundation.">
<section class="inner-hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Riders Helping Riders</div><h1>There's a Place<br/><span class="accent">For You Here.</span></h1></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap"><h2>Help Build GEAR</h2><p class="lede">We are developing a rider-led community rooted in practical help and safer riding. You do not need to own a particular motorcycle, belong to a riding club, or ride at all to support the mission.</p><div class="cards gear-balanced-three"><article class="card"><h3>Events</h3><p>Help with check-in, route coordination, venue relations, volunteer support, and mission outreach when events launch.</p></article><article class="card"><h3>Community</h3><p>Introduce us to local riders, dealerships, shops, training providers and potential host businesses.</p></article><article class="card"><h3>Professional Skills</h3><p>Contribute experience in nonprofit operations, marketing, legal compliance, finance, safety, medical support, and technology.</p></article></div><div class="program-callout"><strong>Volunteer status:</strong> Formal positions and onboarding procedures are being developed. Participation is not a condition of program eligibility.</div><div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-red" href="mailto:info@gearmotofoundation.org?subject=GEAR%20Volunteer%20Interest">Express Interest</a></div></div></section></Base>